                                                "sense_id": "342d2e03-4607-3718-919e-c185fab98eca",
                                                "text": "He spread avicide in his field to try to kill some of the rooks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8d7c245-1fd9-4176-919a-e8d2f98d7b56",
